WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.752 --> 00:00:03.740
JEN PERSON: Today, we're
talking about Google Cloud Next.

00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:06.830
I'm Jen Person, and welcome
to "This Week in Cloud," where

00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:10.010
we serve you the
lowest latency news

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:12.410
from the safety of our home.

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:15.500
Google Cloud Next
OnAir begins next week.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.140
This digital interpretation
of our annual conference

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:20.090
will offer nine
weeks of programming

00:00:20.090 --> 00:00:21.980
to help you solve
your toughest business

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.990
challenges in the cloud.

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:25.880
And the best part
is you can join in

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:27.900
for free, no matter
where you are

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:30.930
and at a time that
works for you.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:32.810
Be sure to register
beforehand so that you

00:00:32.810 --> 00:00:35.090
can build a customized
playlist of the content

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:36.590
you're interested in.

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:38.690
In the session
catalog, you can filter

00:00:38.690 --> 00:00:41.750
by speaker, topic, or
industry, so you can

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.030
be sure not to miss a thing.

00:00:44.030 --> 00:00:46.070
Each week, during
Next, we'll be adding

00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:49.430
a new batch of breakout sessions
you can watch on demand.

00:00:49.430 --> 00:00:51.830
We've also got a lineup
of digital demos,

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:56.430
weekly hands-on challenges, and
even a unique learning series.

00:00:56.430 --> 00:00:58.710
And if you need a
bit more support,

00:00:58.710 --> 00:01:01.160
you can book a 15-minute
one-on-one appointment

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:02.900
with a cloud expert.

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:05.250
For the duration of the
event, "This Week in Cloud"

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:07.100
will be covering
highlights and sessions

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:08.840
you won't want to miss.

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:11.180
Each episode will
introduce that week's theme

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:14.540
and then give you a preview of
some of our favorite content.

00:01:14.540 --> 00:01:17.150
If you want to read more
about Google Cloud Next,

00:01:17.150 --> 00:01:18.510
check out the link.

00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:19.920
Any thoughts or ideas?

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:21.660
Leave us a comment, or tweet us.

00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:24.940
And we'll see you in the cloud.

